window.products.push({"id":231003,"name":"Durable Compact Travel Laundry Bags, Drawstring Closure| Family Value Set for Vacation, Camping, Gym and Home Use (3-Pack, Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xq-namsBL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"Don't get out of sorts on laundry day With our 3-pack of polyester fabric laundry bags, you'll save time separating whites from colors and delicates from permanent press. Just add dirty clothes to the appropriate bag during the week and your laundry is pre-sorted when you come home from vacation or arrive at the laundromat. Do you or your spouse have an unsavory job that leaves unpleasant odors on clothes? Use a bag to stow soiled work clothes in; tight drawstring closures keep odors locked inside. Our reusable laundry bags are machine washable so you can throw them right in with your colors and return them to their fresh, like-new condition. Roomy and ready to go These sturdy dirty laundry bags measure 20\" x 27\" so they hold a week's worth of clothes each. You can fold them flat and pack them in your luggage, and then add clothes to them during your trip. This makes it easy to send out laundry with your cabin steward or room valet for washing, or tote clothes back home in your luggage, already sorted and ready to wash. This family-size value pack provides enough bags to hold a vacation’s worth of laundry. Versatile and reliable You'll find countless uses for our laundry bags. Keep one in your gym bag to separate sweaty workout clothes. Add one to your overnight bag for the previous day's outfit. Their space-saving design is ideal for the limited storage area of a cruise ship cabin or an RV. Wherever you need to keep laundry corralled, these bags are at your service. We offer a 75-Day Guarantee for your peace of mind. If our bags don’t meet your expectations, return them for a 100% refund. Make a clean break from laundry day drudgery. Add our Durable Compact Red Laundry Bag Set to your cart today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xq-namsBL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Family Cruise Kits","source_asin":"B075B3L74F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231003","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075B3L74F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075B3L74F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
