window.products.push({"id":231007,"name":"Anyfun Personal fan, Hands Free Neck Fan USB Portable Fan Rechargeable with Colorful LED Flashing,2000mAh Battery,360° Rotation,Lower Noise but Strong","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ow-hOUk7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"ABS 【Stay Cool in All Summer】Anyfun Hands Free Fan is your best partner who will work with you to fight against the Unbearable Hot Summer. REAL 2000mAh LARGE CAPACITY BATTERY will keep you stay cool for 2-7 Hours(Depends on the Speeds) without constantly holding a heavy handheld fan, 360° rotatable dual fans will satisfy your cool experience from all angles. Perfect for outdoor festivals, fishing, camping, barbecue, watching match, mountaineering, hiking, beach trips and so on. 【High Quality Workmanship and Materials】Excellent product quality has always been our pursuit,100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION is our greatest encouragement. Therefore, unlike most ordinary and conventional existing fans on the market, Anyfun Wearable Fans are made from high-grade ABS and rubber materials, assembled by superb workmanship, and undergoed multiple inspection processes, finally they will reach your side. 【Anti-involved Hair Design】Different from conventional fans, Anyfun Portable Rechargeable Fans are upgraded with unique new features---Equipped with anti-involved function for long hair users, no worry about you would be if your hairs get cought by fans blades. Anyfun Neck Fans are not only get your hands free, but also let your long hair dance freely and show your unique style. What you can do is just feeling the summer cool it brought to you. 【USB Rechargeable Colorful LED Flashing Fans】Anyfun Mini Personal Hanging Neck Fan provides 7 color-Flashing LED lights(seven color lights,blue light,no light) and aromatherapy box(you can fill the cotton and drip your favorite perfume). It's not only can keep you fresh,but also can illuminate, very cool at night. You can charge the fan via a USB cable. And the USB cable that comes with the fan compatible with any USB port, such as PC, laptops, power bank, and regular socket and so on. 【4 Speeds Low Noise Design Powerful Fan】Anyfun USB Portable Fan owns a seven-blade design which provides more powerful airflow, it is smoother and quieter. What's more, it is available with Low/Medium/High speed levels according to your individual needs. Low noise(＜30dB) of portable mini fan won't disturb your concentrated work. It is a wonderful summer gift for your friends and families.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ow-hOUk7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anyfun","source_asin":"B08BJ274Z2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BJ274Z2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BJ274Z2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
