window.products.push({"id":231079,"name":"Mumaxun 3pcs 32mm Vacuum Cleaner Attachment Wand Extension Tube Pipe Hose Tool fit all Central Vacuum Round Metal or Plastic Wands with 1-1/4\" Diamete","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515aAe6h9fL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"18-inch Plastic Wand. Every central vacuum system needs at least a couple of these! Very light weight and sturdy. Just under 18\" long. Reach high by connecting 2 - 3 - 4 - or more together. Save your hard wood floors from metal wands. Connect two together to use with your favorite hard floor tool and central vacuum hose. Add Vac-U-Reach to dust directly on top of high surfaces such as cabinets, walls, lamps, picture frames and more. Compatible with all central vacuum round metal or plastic wands with 1-1/4\" diameter. Works with friction fit and button locking wands (the lock remains depressed as wand is inserted).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515aAe6h9fL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mumaxun","source_asin":"B07C7Q9N97","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C7Q9N97","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C7Q9N97","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
