window.products.push({"id":231083,"name":"Kebury Queen Size Quilt Set Christmas Bedding Floral Bedspread Poinsettia Reversible Quilts Red Flowers Holiday Xmas Bedding Soft Lightweight Coverlet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KdoFbS05L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[MATERIAL & DURABLE]: Made of 100% high quality thin lightweight breathable microfiber polyester, it is cozy and breathable even after washing. Poinsettia Quilt stitching and tight seams will not unravel, allowing for many years use. [DESIGN DETAILS]: Red Bedspread two sides are designed differently. One side is mainly red poinsettia floral, holly leaves, green pinecones, the other side is a dark red background, printed with small leaves, polka dots. Holiday Quilts Queen Size easily cover all sides and end of your bed, highly recommended for your bedroom decorations. Beautiful Floral Quilt Set that brings you a happy and sweet dreams. [3 PIECE QUILT SET]: When open the delicate package, which comes with a portable gift bag and a luxurious color product paper card. You’ll get 1 quilt (90\" x 90\"), 2 queen size pillow shams (20\"x26\"+2\"). Bedspreads queen, which bring a decorative, cozy and relaxing sleeping environment when put it on the bed. [MULTI-PURPOSE USAGE]: Perfect floral coverlet quilt for All Season, a little cool feeling for the hot weather, also can use in winter as a blanket. And can put on sofa as a daybed cover. Order 1 set and use all season. Ideal gift for your family members,friends and pets. Also perfect freshness decoration for bedroom, guest room, kids room,vacation home,hotel or cabin room. [Care Instruction]: 3 Piece Red Floral Quilts Set adopts high technology printing, having a feature of anti-fading, shrinking properties, long life. Reversible Holiday Flower Bedding are durable. Please wash before use. Machine wash in cold. Fast drying at low temperature. It will be better to wash in the laundry bag, which could preferably protect the coverlet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KdoFbS05L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kebury","source_asin":"B0B4G1YWVZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4G1YWVZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4G1YWVZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
