window.products.push({"id":231147,"name":"Skyros Designs Oversized 20 oz Cantaria Breakfast Cup Pair (Caramel)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fsWpK198L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FREEZER, OVEN, MICROWAVE, DISHWASHER SAFE: Skyros Designs' 20 oz. oversized Cantaria Breakfast Cup is handcrafted in Portugal of a fine, thin stoneware body, which is extremely durable and chip resistant. Our dinnerware and accessories go straight from the freezer into a 500 degree preheated oven. SKYROS DESIGNS: Skyros Designs was born in the South where entertaining is a way of life. At Skyros Designs we share a passion for life, laughter, family and hard work. Throughout the years, our goals and values remain the same. We are committed to beautiful design, unsurpassed quality and the best customer service in our industry. HANDCRAFTED IN PORTUGAL: Our skilled artisans take extreme pride in their work and go to great lengths to guarantee our customers the highest quality products available. The Portuguese are warm, friendly, gracious, fiercely loyal to their families and friends, and delight in sharing their beautiful country, culture, lifestyle and traditions. All of this is reflected in Skyros Designs products. SKYROS DESIGNS CANTARIA BREAKFAST CUP: One secret to a happy family is giving everyone their own breakfast cup. They will all covet this glorious 20 oz. oversized cup for that luscious creamy hot chocolate or latte. Paired with Cantaria’s small oval platter it’s delightful for a steamy hot soup and sandwich on a cold winters day. We think it is the perfect cup for every day of the year. CANTARIA COLLECTION: The organic shape and hammered texture of our Cantaria dinnerware and serveware collection offers a traditional look as well as sophisticated, modern elegance. This is the charm and beauty behind Cantaria. Mix, match, and play with colors and textures to create your own delightful table. We design our collections for your everyday celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fsWpK198L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Skyros Designs","source_asin":"B09HSKSW1M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HSKSW1M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HSKSW1M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
