window.products.push({"id":231375,"name":"Wool Pressing Mat 10 X 10 inches Wool Ironing Pad for Quilting, Suitable for All Ironing Station","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Kzjn4P0cL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Our 100% Felted Wool Ironing Mat retains heat and transfers it back to whatever you're ironing. It's like ironing both sides of your fabric at the same time. The size of each mat is 10\" x 10\" and 1/2\" thickness that provides extra protection for any ironing surface. The appropriate dimension and the flexible material make it easy to Iron at any location and create an ironing station. Care instructions: Do not leave your iron on the wool mat for too long. Use of steam: With prolonged use of steam during ironing, a small amount of moisture can pass through the mat, since wool is a porous material. Cleaning: Simply rinse it in sink or bath and hang to dry. Note, do not wash with machine. Drying: When wet, simply hang to dry. Avoid twisting or bending. Storage: Avoid folding or rolling. Find a flat surface and place it there. Also avoid storing the mat when it is damp or wet. For people sensitive to wool fragrance: you may experience a slight smell of wool at the beginning, not to worry, it fades off after a number of use. Rest assured the odor will not be transferred to your fabric and disappear soon after your ironing is done.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Kzjn4P0cL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Conveasy","source_asin":"B0885XCYGC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231375","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0885XCYGC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0885XCYGC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
