window.products.push({"id":231505,"name":"Insulated Lunch Bag for Women/Men, Reusable Lunch Box for Office Work School Picnic Beach, Leakproof Bag Freezable Lunch Bag with Adjustable Shoulder ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XZk7UkjNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Materials：The outside of the lunch cooler bag is made of high-density waterproof and stain proof oxford cloth, ensuring durability and easy cleaning. It can also be used outdoors in rainy days. The lining is made of environment-friendly high-quality aluminum film and filled with 6mm EPE foam to improve heat resistance. Advanced Thermal Efficiency：Exquisite five layer thermal insulation design. The outer surface is made of wear-resistant nylon fabric and a layer of waterproof PVC. The inner layer is made of thicker reinforced food grade PEVA material, seamless ultrasonic welding, 100% leak proof and tear resistant. It is the perfect lunch bag for work, school, business travel and daily travel. Easy to Carry：The reinforced zipper with charming tail rope will not get stuck, and it is easier to open and close. The webbing and cushion handle are fully sewn together, which is tear resistant, comfortable to hold, and will not strangle your hands. The lunch bag is also equipped with a detachable and adjustable long shoulder strap, giving you two choices to carry the bag comfortably. Large Capacity： The cool bag is large enough to hold the necessities for a family picnic. The large lunch bag can easily hold all your beer, snacks, drinks, sandwiches, fruits and lunch boxes. In addition, the front and side extra pockets can hold small items such as keys and earplugs. Multi Function： large capacity, long heat preservation time, and can also hold various snacks and lunches. You can take it to the picnic on weekends, take lunch and snacks to the office, and take cold beer to the beach. It is an ideal companion for storing lunch, snacks and drinks when traveling or going to school. Suitable for men, women and children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XZk7UkjNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chivalral","source_asin":"B0B97NL3H3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B97NL3H3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B97NL3H3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
