window.products.push({"id":231530,"name":"YEMYHOM Couch Cover Latest Jacquard Design High Stretch Sofa Covers for 2 Cushion Couch, Pet Dog Cat Proof Loveseat Slipcover Non Slip Magic Elastic F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ab0Rnp-bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"New Checkered Design: Different from some other couch covers with small checks on Amazon, YEMYHOM upgraded magic sofa cover adopts 0.6 by 0.6 inches large checks jacquard design, so that it looks more elegant, fashionable and generous. And the 280GSM high gram thickened fabric makes the fitted couch slipcover more durable, soft and comfortable to touch, no pilling, no fading, breathable for all season usage Perfectly Fit: These Super Stretchable elastic sofa slipcovers are flexible enough to fit most types sofas and looks like customized, made by 95% polyester microfiber and 5% spandex premium quality fabric, highly recommended for cloth or leather sofas, high back sofas, t-cushion sofas, box cushion sofas, etc. Save your money by its multifunction in a real sense. Anti-slip Foam Rods are Free-provided to make the couch protector covers stay in place and wrinkle-free All-Round Protection: YEMYHOM anti-slip sofa protector cover ensure your couch fully covered with stretchy band wrapping the bottom tightly. Whether it's cat/dog hairs and scratches, or naughty kids' graffiti and unexpected stains from everyday life, it will transform your sofa from old to new and always keep new. Not only functional to protect your couch, but also decorative to lighten your living room decor, first selection of modern families Size & Installation: LENGTH of CHAIR COVER 31-46″, LOVESEAT COVER 55-69″, SOFA COVER 71-91″, XL SOFA COVER 91-110″. The more specific slip cover size measurement is noted in the sixth listing photos, please refer to it and check how long is your sofa before purchasing. If it's between two sizes, select larger one. Installation Guide of the universal furniture cover is also displayed, it can be finished within 8 mins by yourself easily, saving your time Washing Tips: This is a Removable form-fitting furniture protector, taken off easily for washing when getting dirty. Machine washable, separately in cold water, no bleaching, no ironing. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED - We are proud of the quality of our magical fit 1-piece slipcovers for couches and loveseats and chairs, and we know you'll love it. This is why we back it with 100% Money Back Guarantee, to help you buy with confidence","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ab0Rnp-bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YEMYHOM","source_asin":"B08THN844H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08THN844H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08THN844H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":231531,"name":"Genuine Authentic Sheepskin Rug One Pelt Black 2x3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EdqqCkKiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bowron Sheepskins have been hand crafted with pride by G.L.BOWRON & CO. LTD. New Zealand since 1879 when two brothers, George and William Bowron, master tanners of Yorkshire, England, set sail for Christchurch in the new colony of New Zealand. They were to embark on a new life and carve out their personal dream of developing and opening up a tannery bearing their own name. At the time, the population of Christchurch was a modest 29,000 but already the surrounding province of Canterbury was considered to be the leading agriculture centre of New Zealand, renowned for the quality of its sheep flocks. As the small tannery flourished in Christchurch, a family tradition of excellence in lambskin and sheepskin tanning and manufacturing began. After going from strength to strength in the intervening years, BOWRON, during the late 1990’s led the world with the introduction of the new bench mark in the tanning process known as the ‘Whitan Process’. This process quickly became internationally recognized as a break through, resulting in improved quality and significantly reduced environmental impact. During this period BOWRON invested considerable capital in the construction of a new state of the art tannery. The new closed loop Whitan process, combined leading edge chemistry with the accumulated 100 years of heritage and hand crafting knowledge and experience. A company that never rests on its laurels, BOWRON’s ethos is to focus on the future with out forgetting the path it has already travelled.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EdqqCkKiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bowron","source_asin":"B00GI6855W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GI6855W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GI6855W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
