window.products.push({"id":231654,"name":"Spectrum Diversified Ashley Flat Holder with Weighted Arm, Kitchen Napkin Dispenser, Sturdy Steel Kitchen & Dining Room Decor, 1 EA, Bronze","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DFZ8P53fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"An appealing approach to napkin organization and storage, the Ashley Weighted Napkin Holder from Spectrum Diversified is ideal for any tabletop, countertop or napkin worthy location and occasion. Flat napkin holder makes it easy to grab a napkin when you need to wipe your face, protect your lap from dropped food, or soak up a spill. Place on the dining table, kitchen countertop, picnic blanket, or breakfast nook. A weighted pivoting arm holds napkins neatly in place while allowing easy access for dispensing and refilling. The hefty napkin holder holds its own in windy outdoor conditions. Sturdy steel does not tip or shift, and the weighted arm keeps your napkins in place. Arm smoothly slides upward for you to remove a napkin or refill the stock. Durable construction ensures the napkin dispenser will last. The thick-gauge steel wire does not bend easily, and the smooth welds will not puncture or tear paper napkins. Metal construction is heavy-duty and durable. Designed to coordinate with any décor. Celebrate form, function, and style with one uniform look. The modern lines paired with classic finishes create a traditional appearance with a slight modern flair. Designed to coordinate with a variety of fixtures. Made of sturdy steel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DFZ8P53fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spectrum Diversified","source_asin":"B082XWPTR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231654","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082XWPTR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082XWPTR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":231655,"name":"Sprint Wing Car (Choose Your Number to put on wings & Name below car) Desk Style, or Flat to the Wall Mount Award Trophy Logo Lighted Edge Lit Light U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":63.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81skEiOCrEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Welcome to the home of the ORIGINAL ValleyDesignsND acrylic designs! No chains, No suction cups, No heavy wood boxes, just a very lightweight acrylic sign made in wall or desk models.  Made right here in the USA, our signs are full size, made by experienced \"signtists\" and expert craftsmen with over a decade of experience. We use the highest quality, thick rigid crystal clear acrylic, with the highest detail possible.  Style/Size 1: Our 11\" wide desk model varies in height depending on the object pictured. It has a 12\" wide black reflective acrylic mirror base, and an AC adapter. Our optional external battery box can be used for short term use such as shows & events.  Style/Size 2: This wall model is 11\" wide, and varies in height depending on the object pictured, and has a thin black strip on the lighting edge that holds the LEDs. This model includes an AC adapter and lightweight brushed aluminum standoffs for mounting. An external battery box can be used for short term use like at car shows and events.  Style/Size 3 & 4: Both styles 1 & 2, desk & wall models also come in our awesome 21\" wide style.  If you do not see the design you are looking for, be sure to search by model name, not the make, or feel free to ask. We always have models not listed yet. We have sizes up to 4' x 2'. Please feel free to contact us if needed, we will be glad to help.  Our available colors are: Red Blue Green Orange Turquoise White & Purple ......or You can choose our amazing pro model color changing option. This option has a remote control with 20 pre-defined colors, or, you can program your own custom colors. In addition, you'll have control of the brightness, speed of color changes, strobes, fades, transitions, and much more! You can also save and retrieve 3 of your custom color settings.  You can purchase the short term battery box in our Store under VVD External Battery.  PROUDLY MADE IN THE USA!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81skEiOCrEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ValleyDesignsND","source_asin":"B07JDJFCHF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JDJFCHF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JDJFCHF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
