window.products.push({"id":231760,"name":"Cozy Castle Velvet Dining Chairs Set of 2, Accent Chairs with Petals Back for Bedroom, Upholstered Comfy Chairs for Kitchen, Bedroom, Makeup Room, Off","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VEi+R1OzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌸【Velvet Fabric for Maximum Comfort】A skin-friendly velvet fabric combined with soft foam provides you with an maximum comfortable sitting experience. In addition, compared to ordinary PU Leather, our Dining Chairs are more breathable, so you won't sweat even if you sit for a long time. And compared with the traditional linen fabric, velvet material is softer and easier to clean. 🌸【Cute Petals Style】 The backrest adopts C-shaped petal design, adding a unique artistic aesthetic to your home. Cozy Castle Velvet Dining Chair is suitable for bedrooms, living rooms, dining rooms, offices and waiting rooms. It can be paired with your dresser and work desk, allowing you to experience ultimate comfort in your daily life at all times. 🌸【Embracing Wrap-around Seatback】Designed with the wrap-around seat back, the Dining Chairs gives you more security and comfort. In addition, the ergonomic design soothes the lumbar muscles well and allows you to sit down and enjoy relaxing immediately, helping you to relax in the most cozy way after a long day's work. 🌸【Adjustable Non-slip Leg Pads】With the adjustable pads on this Dining Room Chair, even on an uneven floor, you can keep the Vanity Makeup Chair stable and not shaky, and this pad is also silent during movement and protects the floor during movement. Besides, made of high quality metal to make our dining chairs more stable and durable. 🌸【Dining Chairs Dimension】Overall Size: 20.86\"W x 20.86\"D x 29.72\"H; Back Size: 20.86\"W x 13.4\"H; Seat Size: 18.89\"W x 16.14\"D. Due to manual measurement, the actual size of the Side Chair may vary slightly from the picture. Our Cozy Castle is a great 365-day companion for any problem. Any questions? Please do not hesitate to let us know and solve them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VEi+R1OzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cozy Castle","source_asin":"B09Z66VP71","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z66VP71","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z66VP71","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
