window.products.push({"id":231784,"name":"Hydro Clay Pebbles Grow Medium - 5L 10L 25L & 50L Bags - Great Growing Media Used In Aquaponics and Hydroponics - PLUS FREE SAMPLE MR STACKY POT INCLU","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CZUVPlAmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The basic material is a lightweight aggregate bold clay. It is burned in rotary kilns where the clay is expanding into small 'Pebbles'. The firing process removes all excess organic material. The hydro clay pebbles consists of thousands of tiny air cells with a hard shell of baked clay. Hydro Clay Pebbles can be used in the bottom of pots and containers providing a natural moisture balance and helps prevent overwatering. Hydro Clay Pebbles can be used by themselves or with soil. When using soil mix at a ratio of 1:3 Providing a good blend with enough space to have natural root development. Primary characteristics Density: 300-385 kg / m³ Chloride content: max 0.02% Acid-soluble sulfate: max 0.5% Total sulfur content: max 0.32%","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CZUVPlAmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stacky Clay Balls","source_asin":"B00IGHWF0C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IGHWF0C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IGHWF0C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
