window.products.push({"id":231966,"name":"Aston & Arden Tencel Pillowcase Set - Eco-Friendly Eucalyptus, Ultra Soft, Silky & Cool, Breathable, Sustainable Sourced, 2-Piece Pillow Cover Cases, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51duZMOEIsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NATURALLY COOLING EUCALYPTUS SHEET SETS: Our undeniably luxurious Aston & Arden pillowcase sets are cool and silky to the touch. Tencel Lyocell fibers, derived from eucalyptus trees, align with the body's natural thermal regulation system for a truly restful sleep. Performance features, including high breathability, 70% more moisture-wicking than cotton, and natural hypoallergenic properties, all make these pillow covers suitable for sensitive skin. Sleep never felt so good! SHEET SETS FOR THE LUXE BEDROOM: Our 5-star hotel quality sheets are softer to the touch than other sheets. Envelop yourself in the beautiful comfort of our silky smooth sheets and enjoy a restful and refreshing sleep. Enjoy luxe comfort in a timeless color palette for the most sophisticated bedrooms. SHEET SET COLORS INSPIRED BY NATURE: A cosmopolitan collection of sophisticated earth tones, including sky blue, true navy, winter grey, slate grey, creamy white, beignet beige, and wedding white. Make a bold decor statement in any bedroom with distinguished home textiles from this refined color palette by Aston & Arden. SUSTAINABLE EUCALYPTUS TENCEL LYOCELL SHEET SETS: These luxurious sheets are made with Tencel Lyocell. A fiber derived from the pulp of sustainably managed eucalyptus trees. Tencel Lyocell harvests from FSC & PEFC certified and controlled sources in a closed-loop production process. As a renewable resource, Tencel Lyocell earned the United States Department of Agriculture (USDA) BioPreferred designation. ENVIRONMENTALLY RESPONSIBLE BEDDING: Enjoy peace of mind knowing that Tencel Lyocell queen sheet sets are produced by environmentally responsible processes from the sustainably sourced natural eucalyptus wood that safeguards resources for future generations. Tencel Lyocell is on track for net-zero emissions by 2050, prioritizing the continuous reduction of carbon emissions through efficient production, new technologies, and renewable energy sources.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51duZMOEIsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aston & Arden","source_asin":"B0BHL55BC1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHL55BC1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHL55BC1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":231967,"name":"National Palace Museum Wooden Music Bell with Floating Little Boat, Along The River During The Qingming Festival","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5197dQupWNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"National Palace Museum Shop The museum shop contains more than 3300 products inspired by NPM’s collection preserving 7000 years of Chinese artifacts and culture. Design The design of this music bell is inspired by National Palace Museum's collection, Along the River During the Qingming Festival, Qing dynasty. When the wind-up music bell is fastened, the little boat will begin floating through the ancient Bian River in the Northern Song capital, Kaifeng, recreating what it was like to pass through the festivities during the Qingming Festival. The item makes an ideal collectible piece and also a great gift. Along the River During the Qingming Festival,Court painters, Qing Dynasty (1644-1911) Handscroll, ink and colors on silk, 35.6 x 1152.8 cmThe original upon which this work is based, by Chang Tse-tuan (active early 12th century), is a masterful unfolding of Sung dynasty life and customs at the capital of Pien (K'ai-feng) in a long handscroll format. This theme, popular in the Northern Sung (960-1126), has been copied often throughout the ages. There are seven versions alone in the National Palace Museum, and this one by court painters of the imperial painting academy under the Ch'ien-lung Emperor (reigned 1736-1795) is one of the most famous. Each version reflects not only the painting style but also life and appearances of the period it was made.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5197dQupWNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"National Palace Museum","source_asin":"B07G9YCKG2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G9YCKG2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G9YCKG2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
