window.products.push({"id":231969,"name":"Hap Tim 4x6 Picture Frame White Wooden Photo Frames for Tabletop Display and Wall Decoration, Set of 4 (CWH-4x6-WT)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IUaX6vy1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE AND FLEXIBLE: Picture frames 4x6 feature mounted hanging hardware for vertical or horizontal wall hanging or an easel back to fit with your favorite photos on a tabletop or desktop display. SUPERIOR QUALITY: 4x6 picture frame is made of high-quality and environmentally-friendly MDF wood with exquisite design,you can feel a level of durability, and real glass and sturdy backboards protect your memorable grandchildren picture frame against scratch and dust for years. EASY TO INSTALL: Wood picture frames 4x6 are well constructed,convenient and safer to use. Easy-open tabs on the back let you load and change family picture frame very easily. ELEGANT DESIGN: Stylish white picture frame adds the finishing touches to your memories, and coordinates well with any decor,whether it's modern or vintage. PERFECT GIFT: The frames 4x6 are a great gift idea for Christmas,birthday,graduation,wedding,baby shower,anniversary,housewarming,fathers day,mothers day. Collage grandparents/grandchildren picture frames are great to show your cherished memories and add warmth to your space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IUaX6vy1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hap Tim","source_asin":"B0C3QR5MYX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231969","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3QR5MYX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3QR5MYX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":231970,"name":"COOKER KING 5 Quart Enameled Cast Iron Dutch Oven Stovetop Casserole Cookware Braising Pot, Porcelain Enamel Coated Cast-Iron Baking Pots with Lid Cla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AgsP72VlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍳【OUTSTANDING ENAMEL NON-STICK】Enameled solid cast-iron offers superior and even heat retention while vibrant porcelain-enamel exterior offers contemporary styling.The more use, the better pot. 🍳【SAFE ON ALL COOKERS】The casserole is perfect for all hobs up to 245 °C/475°F. Oven and dishwasher safe,PFOA- and PTFE-free porcelain enamel cooking surface. 🍳【MULTIFUNCTION & LARGE CAPACITY】The Cast Iron Dutch Oven with Lid features a 5QT capacity made of heavy duty cast iron metal. Has a broad base that allows maximum room for searing. An all-in-one cooking pot that lets you sauté, simmer, braise, bake, roast & fry. 🍳【SELF-BASTING LID & HEAT DIFFUSION】Thickened induction base for maximum retention and fast heat transfer, energy saving.Designed to catch steam as it rises in the pot & condense the steam back into water inside the snug fitting cast iron lid. 🍳【INDUCTION READY】These enamel cast iron pots are compatible w/ all heating methods. Works on gas, induction, glass ceramic & electric stove top. It is stain-resistant and easy to clean. Enjoy traditional casserole cooking style with the whole family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AgsP72VlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COOKER KING","source_asin":"B08395751L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231970","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08395751L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08395751L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
