window.products.push({"id":231990,"name":"Bluegrass Living Vent Free Natural Gas Log Set - 30 Inch Traditional Oak, 32,000 BTU, Remote Control - Model# B30NR-ES1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91o5K5FId2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Bluegrass Living Traditional Oak Vent Free Log runs off of Natural Gas. This unique log set offers a natural look and feel of a real wood-burning fireplace. The log set was developed from real wood to reflect a split stack with focus on blending bark and split features along with charring to create an exquisite look to your fireplace and magnify the beauty of your home.This high-end log set also features a large Ember Burner chassis design which provides one row of flames and a glowing ember bed to create a realistic wood burning fire look. The large glowing ember bed appearance gives the appearance of glowing embers that have fallen from the logs, giving an even more lifelike look. The Thermostatic Remote Control feature can easily regulate the 32,000 BTU to create the perfect heat setting for your home.Product Features: •32,000 BTU Heats up to 1,300 sq. ft.•Operates off Natural Gas Only•Thermostat Remote Control Included – This remote-controlled unit allows you to set your desired heat temperature and control your log set by using the included remote control. (System Requires 4 AA and 2 AAA Batteries – Included)•The LCD screen of the remote control displays current room temperature in °F or °C, Burner On/Off Indication and Thermostat or Manual Mode Indication.•8 hand painted realistic detailed logs using superior refractory ceramics to ensure a long lifespan•Solid, well-built black powder coated chassis•Ember Burner chassis design provides one row of flames and a glowing ember bed to create a realistic fire•High End Ember Burner chassis has a large glowing ember bed appearance and gives a more lifelike look•Economical: 99.9% efficient. No outside duct or chimney needed!•Safety Assurance: SAFETY PILOT O.D.S. (Oxygen Depletion Sensor) included with automatic shut-off•Battery Assisted Piezo ignition (Requires 1 AAA Battery - Included)•Must be installed in a masonry or agency approved firebox•Minimum Firebox Size Required: 20” H x 34” W in front (23” W at rear) x 15” D•Safety Assured ANSI Certified System•PFS Approved•Designed for Indoor Use Only•1 bag of glowing ember material included•Ships in 2 Boxes What's In the Box•U-Burner Chassis - Qty. 1•Hand Painted Ceramic Logs - Qty. 8•Thermostat Remote Control - Qty. 1•Receiver Box - Qty. 1•Bag of Embers - Qty. 1•AA Battery - Qty. 4•AAA Battery - Qty. 3•Hardware Pack - Qty. 1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91o5K5FId2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bluegrass Living","source_asin":"B08DK65KVG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-231990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DK65KVG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DK65KVG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
